 "description": "Growth pillar indicators: industrial production (ISM proxy), consumer sentiment, yield curve, initial claims, plus the Atlanta Fed GDPNow nowcast of the quarter in progress. GDPNow carries its own reference_quarter, the publication date of the estimate, and the previous estimate of the SAME quarter, so its direction of travel is readable; it is reported, not scored, so it does not move the classification. When no estimate is on file the block reports status: unavailable and says so in staleness_flags \u2014 not published, which is not the same as zero. Returns classification (green/yellow/red).",
